# UNERA V2 — Success details panel (flow completion)

**Scope:** Important transaction summary on the **final success step** of any multi-step action under `NewUnera/` (Add Money, Exchange, Send, Get/Redeem CAD, Stake, etc.).

**Canonical references:**
- [`NewUnera/add-money.html`](../NewUnera/add-money.html) — `#step-complete` → `.success-details` (~L1250–1278, ~L2286–2302)
- [`NewUnera/exchange.html`](../NewUnera/exchange.html) — `#step-complete` → `.success-details` (~L950–960, ~L1346–1358)
- [`NewUnera/send-enhanced.html`](../NewUnera/send-enhanced.html) — `#step7` success panel

**Related:** [`.cursor/rules/newunera-success-screen-hero.mdc`](newunera-success-screen-hero.mdc) (hero above the panel), [`.cursor/rules/wallet-action-pages.mdc`](wallet-action-pages.mdc).

---

## Placement

Inside the success column, **after** `.success-title` + `.success-amount`, **before** optional `p.input-hint--success-followup`:

```
main#main-content
  └── #step-complete | #step7 | .step-content (final)
        └── .card | .success-screen
              └── .success-icon-animated
              └── h2.success-title
              └── .success-amount
              └── div.success-details          ← this rule
              └── p.input-hint--success-followup (optional)
```

Use **`#step-complete`** for new flows when possible; existing pages may keep flow-specific ids (e.g. Send `#step7`).

---

## Markup contract

```html
<div class="success-details">
  <div class="success-detail-row">
    <span class="success-detail-label">Transaction ID</span>
    <span class="success-detail-value" id="successTxId">—</span>
  </div>
  <div class="success-detail-row">
    <span class="success-detail-label">Date &amp; time</span>
    <span class="success-detail-value" id="successDateTime">—</span>
  </div>
  <div class="success-detail-row">
    <span class="success-detail-label">Status</span>
    <span class="success-detail-value" style="color: var(--success);">Completed</span>
  </div>
</div>
```

| Class | Role |
|-------|------|
| `.success-details` | Tinted left-aligned panel; full width of success column |
| `.success-detail-row` | Flex row: label left, value right; bottom border between rows |
| `.success-detail-label` | Secondary caption (`var(--text-secondary)`, 0.875rem) |
| `.success-detail-value` | Semibold primary value (`var(--text-primary)`, 0.875rem) |

Add **flow-specific rows** above the standard receipt rows (e.g. Destination, Send type, Recipient, Fee, Total for Send). Optional rows use `hidden` on the `.success-detail-row` wrapper.

**Do not** use a single `<p class="success-text">` with `<br>`-separated labels for new or updated success screens — use this panel.

---

## Required CSS (copy from add-money / exchange)

```css
.success-details {
  background: var(--neutral-100);
  border-radius: 0.5rem;
  padding: 1.5rem;
  margin: 2rem 0;
  text-align: left;
}
.success-detail-row {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 1rem;
  padding: 0.75rem 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
}
.success-detail-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.success-detail-label {
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.success-detail-value {
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--text-primary);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  text-align: right;
  word-break: break-word;
}
```

- **Status** value: `color: var(--success)` (maps to `--fin-up`).
- Long addresses: allow `word-break: break-word` on values; monospace optional for wallet strings.
- No CSS gradients on the panel.

---

## Minimum rows by flow

| Flow | Required rows (in addition to Tx ID, Date & time, Status) |
|------|-----------------------------------------------------------|
| Add Money | Payment method |
| Exchange | (amount in hero only) |
| Send | Destination, Send type, Recipient, Fee, Total; Note if provided |
| Get / Redeem CAD | Flow-specific (e.g. You deposited / You redeemed) — may use `.suc-row` alias on redeem tracker; align to same visual when refactoring |

**Always include:** Transaction ID, Date & time, Status (`Completed`).

---

## JS

- Populate `.success-detail-value` spans on transition to the success step.
- Date format: `toLocaleString('en-US', { month: 'short', day: 'numeric', hour: 'numeric', minute: '2-digit' })` or equivalent locale-aware string.
- Toggle optional rows with `row.hidden = true/false` on the `.success-detail-row` element.

---

## Do not

- ❌ Replace panel with centered paragraph + `<br>` lines (`.success-text` pattern)
- ❌ Omit Transaction ID or Status on completion screens
- ❌ Use `--neutral-500` or `--brand-light-blue` for label text (WCAG — use `--text-secondary`)
- ❌ Hardcode hex colors when tokens exist
